{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在音乐细节和情绪的微妙转折上明显不如Y，尤其缺少与具体小节对应的力度、节奏、音色变化及其心理感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的双栏结构让人物叙事和音乐感受各有位置，尤其S11、S12这类短停留段，更容易迅速扫到故事进展，不必同时追读大量不断出现的小字。Y的【】强调确实更利于一眼抓住情绪转折，而且按小节出现的感受能让人听见更具体的音乐变化，细腻度明显胜出。不过X对人物为何动摇、如何反复、最终怎样接受矛盾的叙述更连贯，整体更容易让普通观众听懂并记住这是一段怎样的心理历程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "86757f0f-cff8-48ab-90af-799ef0e77b68", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T074952848044Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:51:47.279501+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a49bc45a20c64ca77f752b0dc45a1cd57b3e82b03ede5cd01556c628314cb99", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att